config BR2_PACKAGE_SMART_LITE
	bool "smart-lite (ATA SMART reader and self-test)"
	help
	  Small C tool reading SMART of libata disks through SG_IO and
	  ATA PASS-THROUGH (16): identity, attributes with thresholds,
	  overall health, temperature, self-test state; -t starts or
	  aborts a SMART self-test. Otherwise read-only commands only; a
	  disk in standby is left asleep unless -f. Replaces smartctl
	  (smartmontools needs C++, absent from the toolchain) for DIET.
	  Installed in /usr/sbin.
